senses.gloss:
प्र-√ 1. धा Ā. -धत्ते, to place or set before, offer, RV.;
to send out (spies), ib. vii, 61, 3;
to give up, deliver, TS.; Kāṭh.;
to devote one's self to (acc.), Lalit.

प्र-√ 1. धाव् P. Ā. -धावति, ˚ते, to run forwards, r˚ forth, r˚ away, set out, start, RV.; ŚāṅkhŚr.; MBh. &c.;
to rush upon, Kathās.;
to run or go to (acc.), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to pervade, permeate, Suśr.;
to become diffused, spread, MBh. :
Caus. P. -धावयति, to put to flight, Kathās.;
to drive away, dr˚, Br.

प्र-√ धू P. Ā. -धूनोति or -धुनोति, ˚नुते, to move forward, PañcavBr.;
to blow away, ChUp.; MBh. : to blow or shake out (the beard after drinking), RV. :
Intens. -दोधुवत्, -दूधोत्, to blow (the beard, acc.);
to blow into (loc.), RV.

प्र-√ धृ (only pf. Ā. -दध्रे, with मनस्), to set the mind upon anything (dat.), resolve, determine, MBh. :
Caus. P. -धारयति, to chastise, inflict a punishment on any one (loc.; cf. दण्डं-√ धृ), MBh.;
to keep in remembrance, ib.;
to reflect, consider, ib.; Pat.;
 (प्रधारयन्तु w.r. for प्र धारा यन्तु, ĀśvGṛ. iii, 12, 14).

प्र-√ धृष् P. -धर्षति, -धृष्णोति, to be bold against, assail with courage or daring, lay hands on, hurt, injure, harass, overpower, overcome, R. :
Caus. P. -धर्षयति id., ib.; KauṣĀr.; MBh. &c.;
to violate (a woman), MBh.;
to destroy, devastate, R.

प्र-√ ध्मा (or धम्) P. (Ā. Pot. -ध्मायीत, ChUp.) -धमति, to blow before or in front, blow away, AV.;
to scare, Car.;
to destroy, MBh.;
to blow into (esp. into a conch shell acc.), ib.; Suśr.; Hariv. &c.;
 (Ā.) to cry out, ChUp. vi, 14, 1; Śaṃk.;
 (others, ‘to be tossed about’, ‘wander about’) :
Caus. P. Ā. -ध्मापयति, ˚ते, to blow into, bl˚ (a conch shell), MBh.; R.; Hariv.

प्र-√ ध्मा (or धम्) P. (Ā. Pot. -ध्मायीत, ChUp.) -धमति, to blow before or in front, blow away, AV.;
to scare, Car.;
to destroy, MBh.;
to blow into (esp. into a conch shell acc.), ib.; Suśr.; Hariv. &c.;
 (Ā.) to cry out, ChUp. vi, 14, 1; Śaṃk.;
 (others, ‘to be tossed about’, ‘wander about’) :
Caus. P. Ā. -ध्मापयति, ˚ते, to blow into, bl˚ (a conch shell), MBh.; R.; Hariv.

प्र-√ ध्यै P. Ā. -ध्यायति, ˚ते, to meditate upon, think of (acc. with or without प्रति), Gobh.; MBh.; Hariv.;
to reflect, consider, MBh.; R.; Kir.;
to excogitate, devise, hit upon, MBh.

प्र-√ ध्वंस् Ā. -ध्वंसते, to flow off (as water), ĀśvGṛ.;
to fall to pieces, perish, ChUp. :
Caus. -ध्वंसयति, to scatter, sprinkle, ŚBr.;
to cause to fall, destroy, cause to perish, MBh.; Śiś.
